  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insitutionsst&#xf6;d till icddr,b, Centrum f&#xf6;r Dirrhoeal Disease Research  i Bangladesh har beviljats avtalsf&#xf6;r&#xe4;ngning d&#xe5; de hade pengar kvar.   Ansvar f&#xf6;r st&#xf6;det ligger p&#xe5; PARTNER/FORSK som l&#xe4;nge har givit ett     forskningsst&#xf6;d p&#xe5; 6 millioner SEK/&#xe5;r. Nytt avtal f&#xf6;r 2012-2016        planeras och kommer att delas mellan FORSK och regionala              Asien/ambassden i Dhaka.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The International Centre for Diarrhoeal Disease Research, Bangladesh  - is an international health research institution located in Dhaka    dedicated to saving lives through research and treatment addressing   some of the most critical health concerns facing the world today,     ranging from improving neonatal survival to HIV/AIDS. This is  the    core support provided by FORSK and Sida&apos;s team in Dhaka.</narrative>
  </description>
